  "details": "TLDR: Apply the same method of phys bone interaction permissions to personal space. \n\nPersonal space is pretty useful but right now the functionality isn’t the best because it’s all or none at the moment. If physical space could be toggled the same way as interactions    I think it would make a better overall experience for users in allowing them to better curate who comes into contact with them. I think making it friends vs everyone else is limiting, that’s why I think it would be better if the framework for interactions was applied to personal space.",
